     2844        BROWSE-2 AT ROW 3.5 COL 2 WIDGET-ID 200
     2845        "Сформированные ошибки:" VIEW-AS TEXT
     2846             SIZE 27 BY .67 AT ROW 2.5 COL 2.5 WIDGET-ID 16
     2847        SPACE(101.62) SKIP(14.36)
     2848       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     2849            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     2850            TITLE "Ошибки документа"
     2851            CANCEL-BUTTON Btn_OK WIDGET-ID 100.
     2852   ASSIGN
     2853          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     2854          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     2855   ASSIGN
     2856          BROWSE-2:COLUMN-RESIZABLE IN FRAME Dialog-Frame       = TRUE.
     2857   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2858   DO:
     2859       APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
     2860     END.
